="0:33.392">顕</span><span begin="0:33.392" end="0:33.640">示</span><span begin="0:33.640" end="0:33.888">飽</span><span begin="0:33.888" end="0:34.128">き</span><span begin="0:34.128" end="0:34.681">た</span></p><p begin="0:37.403" end="0:40.939" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:37.403" end="0:38.555">既視感</span><span begin="0:38.555" end="0:39.251">何</span><span begin="0:39.251" end="0:39.515">が</span><span begin="0:39.515" end="0:39.667">そ</span><span begin="0:39.667" end="0:39.819">ん</span><span begin="0:39.819" end="0:40.067">な</span><span begin="0:40.067" end="0:40.275">不</span><span begin="0:40.275" end="0:40.507">満</span><span begin="0:40.507" end="0:40.615">な</span><span begin="0:40.615" end="0:40.723">ん</span><span begin="0:40.723" end="0:40.939">だ</span><span begin="0:40.938" end="0:40.939">?</span></p><p begin="0:40.939" end="0:42.730" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:40.939" end="0:41.171">散</span><span begin="0:41.171" end="0:41.347">々</span><span begin="0:41.347" end="0:41.522">ワ</span><span begin="0:41.522" end="0:41.691">ガ</span><span begin="0:41.691" end="0:41.867">マ</span><span begin="0:41.867" end="0:42.019">マ</span><span begin="0:42.019" end="0:42.247">語</span><span begin="0:42.248" end="0:42.323">っ</span><span begin="0:42.323" end="0:42.393">と</span><span begin="0:42.393" end="0:42.546">い</span><span begin="0:42.546" end="0:42.730">て</span></p><p begin="0:42.730" end="0:44.552" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:42.730" end="0:42.890">こ</span><span begin="0:42.890" end="0:43.018">れ</span><span begin="0:43.018" end="0:43.178">以</span><span begin="0:43.178" end="0:43.312">上</span><span begin="0:43.312" end="0:43.632">他</span><span begin="0:43.632" end="0:43.808">に</span><span begin="0:43.808" end="0:44.096">何</span><span begin="0:44.096" end="0:44.240">が</span><span begin="0:44.240" end="0:44.392">い</span><span begin="0:44.392" end="0:44.552">る</span><span begin="0:44.551" end="0:44.552">?</span></p></div><div itunes:song-part="PreChorus"><p begin="0:44.552" end="0:49.786" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:44.552" end="0:44.652">そ</span><span begin="0:44.652" end="0:45.013">ん</span><span begin="0:45.013" end="0:45.245">な</span><span begin="0:45.245" end="0:45.541">と</span><span begin="0:45.541" end="0:45.925">こ</span><span begin="0:45.925" end="0:46.325">ろ</span><span begin="0:46.325" end="0:46.845">も</span><span begin="0:46.845" end="0:47.341">割</span><span begin="0:47.341" end="0:47.605">と</span><span begin="0:47.605" end="0:48.074">嫌</span><span begin="0:48.074" end="0:48.418">い</span><span begin="0:48.418" end="0:48.602">じ</span><span begin="0:48.602" end="0:48.786">ゃ</span><span begin="0:48.786" end="0:49.242">無</span><span begin="0:49.242" end="0:49.786">い</span></p></div><div itunes:song-part="Chorus"><p begin="0:52.010" end="0:54.122" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:52.010" end="0:52.370">も</span><span begin="0:52.370" end="0:52.730">う</span><span begin="0:53.090" end="0:53.244">聞</span><span begin="0:53.244" end="0:53.378">き</span><span begin="0:53.378" end="0:53.522">飽</span><span begin="0:53.522" end="0:53.634">き</span><span begin="0:53.634" end="0:53.730">た</span><span begin="0:53.730" end="0:53.826">ん</span><span begin="0:53.826" end="0:53.986">だ</span><span begin="0:53.986" end="0:54.122">よ</span></p><p begin="0:54.122" end="0:55.218" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:54.122" end="0:54.282">そ</span><span begin="0:54.282" end="0:54.428">の</span><span begin="0:54.428" end="0:54.572">セ</span><span begin="0:54.572" end="0:54.730">リ</span><span begin="0:54.730" end="0:55.218">フ</span></p><p begin="0:55.218" end="0:58.691" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:55.218" end="0:55.675">中</span><span begin="0:55.675" end="0:55.906">途</span><span begin="0:55.906" end="0:56.347">半</span><span begin="0:56.347" end="0:56.589">端</span><span begin="0:56.589" end="0:56.818">だ</span><span begin="0:56.818" end="0:57.042">け</span><s